# Deliberately no `node-linker` here.
#
# This file used to say `node-linker=hoisted` with a comment that React Native
# needs a hoisted layout. pnpm 11 (pinned in package.json) does not read
# `node-linker` from .npmrc, so the layout has always been pnpm's default,
# ISOLATED one, and both mobile apps build, bundle and test on it. The isolated
# layout is also what makes "installed in one app only" a real guarantee.
# Do not add a hoisted linker to fix something; find what actually broke.
